     2156                             temp-gds-list.artic     = gds-obj.artic
     2157                           .
     2158                       end.
     2159               end.
     2160       end.
     2161     for each temp-gds-list no-lock
     2162       , first goods  where goods.gds-code  = temp-gds-list.gds-code no-lock
     2163         break
     2164           by gds-obj.grp-name
     2165       by goods.artic :
